## Who We Are

 

Swatch is a Swiss watch brand founded in 1983 in Biel/Bienne, Switzerland.

The brand’s philosophy is captured in two words: positive provocation and

joie de vivre. Swatch democratized Swiss watchmaking by offering affordable,

colorful, high-quality Swiss Made timepieces and transforming watches from

purely functional instruments into wearable expressions of personality and art.

 

