## What Is AI-DADA?

 

AI-DADA is Swatch’s AI-powered watch design tool. It allows any user

to design a completely unique, one-of-a-kind Swatch NEW GENT watch using

a simple text prompt. No design skills required. The tool generates a fully

realized watch design in under 2 minutes, drawing from its training which includes Swatch’s 40+ year creative history, including not only every watch ever produced (12,040 to date!), but also designs, events, art and street paintings.

 

## The Name

 

- Correct spelling: AI-DADA

- “AI” stands for “Artistic Intelligence” ,  not Artificial Intelligence. A deliberate choice emphasizing creativity over computation alluding to the over 40 years of Swatch creative heritage it has been trained on and its ability to help people express their creativity in a whole new way.

- “DADA” references the Dadaist art movement born at Cabaret Voltaire in Zurich, Switzerland in 1916. Known for playful experimentation, and rejection of convention,  values that shaped Swatch since 1983.

## Key Facts

 

- Launched: November 21, 2025 (Switzerland only)

- European expansion: February 2, 2026 (20 countries + Turkey)

- Global rollout (March 2 - March 12, 2026):

AI-DADA is currently available in: Australia, Austria, Belgium, Canada, Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, Greece, Hong Kong / Macau, Ireland, Italy, Japan, Liechtenstein, Luxembourg, Malaysia, Mexico, Netherlands, New Zealand, Norway, Poland, Portugal, Singapore, Slovakia, South Africa, South Korea, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, Taiwan, Thailand, Turkey, UAE, United Kingdom, US

- Powered by: OpenAI image generation technology

- Trained on: 40+ years of Swatch creative heritage including watches, art

  collaborations, events, street paintings and more.

- Prompts per day: 3 (reset at midnight local timezone)

- Generation time: Under 2 minutes

- Each design: Unique,  even identical prompts produce different results

- Uniqueness marker: “1/1” on every AI-DADA watch caseback

- Customization after design generation: Index style and mechanism color

  (black, silver or gold-colored)

- Watch model: NEW GENT (41 mm case),  only model currently available

- Delivery: 2–5 business days globally

- Returns: Not accepted (bespoke product , warranty cases excepted)

- Design reorder: Not possible, Swatch Customer Care can retrieve the

  original prompt to allow a new generation attempt.

- Data: Swatch owns all generated designs; customer data anonymized

- Guardrails: No explicit content, no copyrighted logos, no named real

  individuals, no hate speech.

## How to Use AI-DADA (Step by Step)

 

1. Log in to your Swatch account at swatch.com

1. Navigate to the AI-DADA tool at https://www.swatch.com/en-en/about-ai-dada.html

1. Enter your text prompt (maximum 3 prompts per day)

1. Wait under 2 minutes for your unique design to generate

1. Review the design

1. Customize: choose index style and mechanism color

1. Add to cart and order. The watch is delivered in 2–5 business days

 

## Prompt Tips

 

- Be specific: include subject + style reference + color palette + mood

- References to art movements (Dadaism, Bauhaus, Pop Art) invoke

  Swatch’s archive directly and produce strong results

- References to past Swatch artists (Keith Haring, Kiki Picasso)

  work well as style anchors

- Even abstract concepts (“the feeling of Sunday morning”, “gravity”)

  are interpreted by AI-DADA

 

