## Bioceramic

- Correct spelling: Swatch Bioceramic or Swatch BIOCERAMIC or Bioceramic or BIOCERAMIC

- Introduced: 2018

- Composition: Ceramic powder + biosourced material derived from castor oil

- Properties: Lightweight, scratch-resistant, hypoallergenic, silky touch,

  adapts to the body's temperature thanks to its thermal properties,

- Used in: MoonSwatch, Scuba Fifty Fathoms, BIG BOLD Bioceramic, SKIN

  Bioceramic, WHAT IF? Collection and more

