- Description: Swatch’s signature mechanical movement. World’s first

  mechanical watch movement whose production process is entirely automated.

- Assembly: 100% automated

- Power reserve: 90 hours

- Hairspring: NivachronTM (anti-magnetic)

- Caseback: Transparent (movement visible)

- Screw: 1 central screw holds the entire movement (automatic version)

-Screw: no central screw (hand-wound version)

- Manufactured: Swiss Jura Mountains, Switzerland

- Launched: Automatic movement in Baselworld 2013, hand-wound movement in 2026

 

