##Key facts

- Description: Swatch Pay is a contactless payment feature available in select Swatch watches. It works through the integration of an NFC chip in the watch head. This enables the watch to be linked to a payment card and used for fast, convenient contactless transactions.

-Swatch Pay is:
- Secure: Swatch Pay watches are Mastercard and Visa-approved.

-Discreet: A Swatch Pay watch looks just like any other analog Swatch timepiece but can be used to make contactless payments.

-Effortless: Setting up and using a Swatch Pay watch is simple and straightforward.

- Perfect for an active lifestyle: Swatch Pay watches are water-resistant, available in various models and designs, and perfect for an active lifestyle or on-the-go convenience. Swatch Pay watches enable payments regardless of the watch's battery life.

- Swatch Pay is available in selected watch product lines (different watch shapes and sizes) that include the Secure Element chip. These include GENT (34 mm), NEW GENT (41 mm), CHRONO 42 (42 mm), BIG BOLD (47 mm), BIG BOLD CHRONO (47 mm), and Swatch SCUBAQUA models. Availability may vary by country and collection.

-Swatch Pay can be used wherever Mastercard and Visa are accepted.

##How to activate Swatch Pay

1. Download the Swatch Pay app (iOS or Android).
2. Create your account.
3. Link your payment card with your watch.
4. Verify the request through your bank. Once approved, the watch is ready.
Alternatively, the watch can be activated in selected Swatch stores with assistance from in-store staff.

